				<description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&#34;https://alwaldend.com/docs/infra/nas/tf/&#34;&gt;Terraform package&lt;/a&gt; prepares this owner&amp;rsquo;s DNS records through&#xA;its dedicated Vault AppRole. NAS service provisioning remains outside that root.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;architecture&#34;&gt;Architecture&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#architecture&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This diagram describes the maintained architecture source, not live inventory or service health.&#xA;The &lt;a href=&#34;https://alwaldend.com/docs/infra/nas/docs/architecture.mmd&#34;&gt;Mermaid source&lt;/a&gt; is authoritative; Bazel renders its light and dark SVGs.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://alwaldend.com/docs/infra/nas/docs/assets/architecture.svg&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mermaid-diagram&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://alwaldend.com/docs/infra/nas/docs/assets/architecture.svg&#34; alt=&#34;Truenas architecture&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; class=&#34;mermaid-light&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://alwaldend.com/docs/infra/nas/docs/assets/architecture.dark.svg&#34; alt=&#34;Truenas architecture&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; class=&#34;mermaid-dark&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;links&#34;&gt;Links&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#links&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Docs: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.truenas.com/&#34;&gt;https://www.truenas.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
